n. H7 ТОЛЬКО после PASS H3 и H6: при env auto без explicit false и закрытом TTL подготовить tempfile в ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/,0600, записать {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}, os.replace в dynamic_config.json; убедиться дополнительный disable-serve отсутствует. Следующий native auto запрос на :9883 использует serve без правки start.sh и без повторного рестарта LaunchAgent. H8 повторяет живые проверки рабочего чата, H9 проверяет runtime false/true и disable-file same PID, отдельно kickstart-k crash recovery. Никакой выдачи design/NOT_RUN за runtime PASS. H4 uses ONLY cp bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, then SHA-256 read-back. Never rsync --delete or directory sync. Preserve live dynamic_config.json and disable-serve byte-for-byte (or their recorded absence) from H0 snapshot AFTER any intentional H0 false-write; H0/H4 read back existence/bytes/mode after cp. H5 restarts only after that preservation check; no copy/delete/overwrite of either runtime file. Default=false and true only H7 after H3/H6, no new owner waiver required.\"\n  },\n  \"semantic_checks\": {\n    \"canonical_hl_field_set\": \"46/46 exact key equality and field_sources/field_units equality against team architecture.md §3.0\",\n    \"stop_codes\": \"21 main codes + T-LIFE/O-EXIT/M-SEM=24 unique\",\n    \"legacy_antipatterns\": \"21 exact keys from approved reference schema\",\n    \"verification_owner\": \"5/5 owner=verifier\",\n    \"decisions\": \"4/4 two-way with >=2 genuine alternatives\",\n    \"evidence_refs\": \"71 EVD records,49analystfacts;EVD-075/076 empirically observed isolated current-source copies,not Stage3/live proof;gap065..069 preserved.\",\n    \"status_protocol\": \"3 templates begin[мост]/endLF; при model unterminated line весь дополнительный leading LF synthetic, template bytes модели не менять.\",\n    \"schema_vs_semantics\": \"Installed packet validator does not inspect high_load_envelope/resilience_gates/legac